{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "personality-judgment-framework",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Personality Judgment Framework\n\nStructured method for analyzing communication patterns and personality traits",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 80,
      "color": {
        "background": "#4facfe",
        "border": "#00f2fe",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "analysis-chain",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Core Analysis Chain:\nRaw message → Observable feature → Pattern → Context → Hypothesis → Confidence → Evidence",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 60,
      "color": {
        "background": "#43e97b",
        "border": "#38f9d7",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "subject-profile",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Subject Profile\n• ID/name, period, platform\n• Message/conversation counts\n• Participants, data quality\n• Missing periods, context",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ff9a9e",
        "border": "#fecfef",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "communication-style",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Communication Style\n• Formal/Casual/Friendly/Neutral\n• Assertive/Defensive/Sarcastic\n• Humorous/Emotional/Technical\n• Reserved styles",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ff9a9e",
        "border": "#fecfef",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "language-pattern",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. Language Pattern\n• Vocabulary: frequent/rare words\n• Slang, technical terms, fillers\n• Sentence style: short/med/long\n• Grammar: person, voice, hedging",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ff9a9e",
        "border": "#fecfef",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "repetition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. Repetition\n• Event, complaint, explanation\n• Person, topic, justification\n• What need does repetition serve?",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ff9a9e",
        "border": "#fecfef",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "response-behavior",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. Response Behavior\n• Work/Technical/Casual\n• Conflict/Personal focus\n• Category distribution %",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#a8edea",
        "border": "#fed6e3",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation-dynamics",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. Conversation Dynamics\n• Initiation: who starts, how often\n• Topic control: introducer/changer/ender\n• Question behavior: asked/answered/ignored/redirected",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#a8edea",
        "border": "#fed6e3",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "conflict-analysis",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7. Conflict & Disagreement\n• Before/During/After phases\n• Defensiveness, explanation, counterargument\n• Topic shifting, silence, repetition\n• Apology, negotiation, escalation",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#a8edea",
        "border": "#fed6e3",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-behavior",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "8. Topic Behavior\n• Frequency, message count, avg length\n• Response time, emotional language\n• Initiation, avoidance/change, recurrence",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#a8edea",
        "border": "#fed6e3",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "baseline-change",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "9. Baseline vs Change\n• Establish normal behavior\n• Detect deviations from baseline\n• Style shifts, topic anomalies\n• Timing alterations, volume changes",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ffecd2",
        "border": "#fcb69f",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "anomaly-detection",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "10. Anomaly Detection\n• Monitor: tone, vocabulary, length\n• Response time, emoji, topic\n• Question frequency, initiation\n• Activity hours, formality, repetition",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ffecd2",
        "border": "#fcb69f",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "context-node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "11. Context Node\n• Temporal: time, day, events\n• Relational: who, history, power\n• Environmental: setting, stressors\n• Developmental: stage, skills, healing\n• Cultural: norms, expectations, scripts\n• Situational: goals, pressures, opportunities\n\n\"Same behavior, different meaning in different context\"",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 140,
      "color": {
        "background": "#ffecd2",
        "border": "#fcb69f",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "hypothesis-layer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "12. Hypothesis Layer\nFor each pattern:\nObservation → Observable Feature → Pattern\n→ Context → Hypothesis → Confidence → Evidence\n\nConfidence: High/Medium/Low/Very Low\nWith justification and supporting/contradicting evidence",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 120,
      "color": {
        "background": "#bbdefb",
        "border": "#90caf9",
        "text": "#ffffff"
      },
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "template-link",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "📄 Use Template:\nTemplates/Personality-Judgment-Analysis.md\n\n📊 View Dashboard:\nTemplates/Personality-Judgment-Dashboard.md\n\n📖 Read Framework:\nSkills-Notes/Personality-Judgment-Framework.md",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": {
        "background": "#c8e6c9",
        "border": "#a5d6a7",
        "text": "#2e7d32"
      },
      "fontSize": 14
    }
  ],
